'''Fried meatballs''' ('''''qofte të fërguara''''') is an Albanian dish.

==Ingredients==
*1 slice stale [[Cookbook:Bread|bread]]
*1 [[Cookbook:Pound|lb]] ground [[Cookbook:Meat|meat]]
*1 small [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], finely-[[Cookbook:Grating|grated]]
*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Feta_Cheese|feta]] cheese
*2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]
*2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]] or melted [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]
*1 tablespoon chopped [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]]
*[[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]
*[[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]
*[[Cookbook:Mint|Mint]]
*[[Cookbook:Oregano|Oregano]]
*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]
*1 cup [[Cookbook:Oil|oil]] ([[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]] recommended)

==Procedure==
#Soak bread in water and squeeze hard to drain. 
#Combine soaked bread, ground meat, bread crumbs, oil or melted butter, onion, cheese, parsley, salt, pepper, and mint, and mix thoroughly.
#Form mixture into 1 [[Cookbook:Inch|inch]]-thick patties, then sprinkle with salt, pepper, and oregano. 
#Roll in flour and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] in hot oil. 
#Serve hot with French fries or mashed potatoes.

